# Backend — FastAPI

Stack: FastAPI, SQLModel, Pydantic v2, pytest, uvicorn.

## Commands (uv only)

```bash
cd backend
uv sync --extra dev     # install deps from pyproject.toml / uv.lock
uv run pytest           # tests — must pass before PR
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
```

## Layout

- `app/routers/` — route handlers
- `app/services/` — business logic
- `app/schemas.py` — Pydantic models
- `app/database.py` — DB session / engine
- `tests/` — pytest (`test_*.py`)

## Conventions

- Follow TDD: write or update tests before implementation.
- Target >80% coverage on app code; do not test frameworks or third-party libs.
- Use async endpoints where I/O-bound; validate with Pydantic schemas.
- CSV export must match `course-outline-generator` syllabus CSV format.

## Do not

- Use `pip install` directly — use `uv add` / `uv sync`.
- Add frontend-only features without a corresponding API route.
